    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97130" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράτιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of an
				army</i> or <i>war, warlike</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρευος στρατιωτέροις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					29
				</span></i>
			 (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροτ-</span>); epith. of
			Zeus, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				401a22
			</span></i>; of Ares, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.757d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατία</span>, of Athena, <i><span class="en">
